					}
				]
			},
			"dialogs": [
				{
					"id": 741870201,
					"content": "Hey, you! Yes, you! You gibbering imbecile! Why do you delay!? Even if we waste away, the treasure won't move itself, surely!",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						741870202
					],
					"speakerTitle": "Leader"
				},
				{
					"id": 741870202,
					"content": "Nay, sir! It's just that they are simply too heavy! We've been at this all day, yet there's still so much left...",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						741870203
					],
					"speakerTitle": "The Dude They Call \"Idiot\""
				},
				{
					"id": 741870203,
					"content": "Where, then, is the intrinsic merit in feeding that prodigious size of yours!? It's treasure, you brute, treasure! Of course it's heavy!",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						741870204
					],
					"speakerTitle": "Leader"
				},
				{
					"id": 741870204,
					"content": "Besides, we \"confiscated\" all these treasures from those accursed barbarians, did we not?",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						741870205
					],
					"speakerTitle": "Leader"
				},
				{
					"id": 741870205,
					"content": "Leaving such wealth in the hands of those insects who live like swine and mongrels would be a terrible waste!",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						741870206
					],
					"speakerTitle": "Leader"
				},
				{
					"id": 741870206,
					"content": "But Sir, don't you think we should've brought a few more ships if we wanted to haul all this back to Remuria?",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						741870207
					],
					"speakerTitle": "The Dude They Call \"Idiot\""
				},
				{
					"id": 741870207,
					"content": "What are you, slow? Imperial cargo ships are not to be used for such a thing!",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						741870208
					],
					"speakerTitle": "Leader"
				},
				{
					"id": 741870208,
					"content": "Well, why don't we destroy what we cannot carry? Better than having it fall into the hands of these savages!",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						741870209
					],
					"speakerTitle": "The Dude They Call \"Idiot\""
				},
				{
					"id": 741870209,
					"content": "Uh, is it just Paimon, or have we heard this conversation before...?",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						741870210,
						741870211
					],
					"speakerTitle": "Paimon"
				},
				{
					"id": 741870210,
					"content": "Sounds like when we first arrived in Petrichor...",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_PLAYER",
					"nextDialogs": [
						741870212
					]
				},
				{
					"id": 741870212,
					"content": "Yeah, those unlucky adventurers we drove off before were saying similar stuff.",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						741870213
					],
					"speakerTitle": "Paimon"
				},
				{
					"id": 741870213,
					"content": "Feels like this round's worse than the last, too!",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						741870214
					],
					"speakerTitle": "Paimon"
				},
				{
					"id": 741870214,
					"content": "Is it possible they were turned into golems after the boat they were on sank?",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						741870215
					],
					"speakerTitle": "Paimon"
				},
				{
					"id": 741870215,
					"content": "That's so creepy!",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						741870216
					],
					"speakerTitle": "Paimon"
				},
				{
					"id": 741870216,
					"content": "Are you of Legio IX? What are you doing here? Should you all not have been ordered to retreat to Fort Charybdis?",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						741870217
					],
					"speakerTitle": "Este"
				},
				{
					"id": 741870217,
					"content": "Hey, Este! Don't you dare ruin our fun, you hear?",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						741870218
					],
					"speakerTitle": "Leader"
				},
				{
					"id": 741870218,
					"content": "These barbarians are less of a threat than dead fish anyway, so just let us have our fun messing about here for a while longer, would you?",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						741870219
					],
					"speakerTitle": "Leader"
				},
				{
					"id": 741870219,
					"content": "These treasures... *sigh* I don't know what orders your Harmost gave you...",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						741870220
					],
					"speakerTitle": "Este"
				},
				{
					"id": 741870220,
					"content": "But did the Sebastos not order us to subdue these ignorant tribes and free them of fate's shackles? Those orders do not include such... clearly criminal deeds.",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						741870221
					],
					"speakerTitle": "Este"
				},
				{
					"id": 741870221,
					"content": "Hah? Surely you jest! The orders of our commander, mighty Dominus Boethius, were indeed to punish these savages harshly.",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						741870222
					],
					"speakerTitle": "Leader"
				},
				{
					"id": 741870222,
					"content": "And besides, we have received no punishment. That means that both Phobos and the Sebastos, our Imperator, approve of our actions.",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						741870223
					],
					"speakerTitle": "Leader"
				},
				{
					"id": 741870223,
					"content": "So what's all this talk about crimes... Are you trying to start trouble?",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						741870224
					],
					"speakerTitle": "Leader"
				},
				{
					"id": 741870224,
					"content": "But...",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						741870225
					],
					"speakerTitle": "Este"
				},
				{
					"id": 741870225,
					"content": "There's another Este here? Well, aren't things getting weirder by the moment?",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						741870226
					],
					"speakerTitle": "Paimon"
				},
				{
					"id": 741870226,
					"content": "It appears that it is time to answer that question of yours.",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						741870227
					],
					"speakerTitle": "Osse"
				},
				{
					"id": 741870227,
					"content": "The Este you met in town must be a descendant of Remurians. His ancestor must have followed me to join the new nation all those years ago, becoming an ordinary Fontainian.",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						741870228
					],
					"speakerTitle": "Osse"
				},
				{
					"id": 741870228,
					"content": "As such, the \"symphony\" that has stolen these Fontainians' souls would not affect him. But in turn, the melody that records his ancestor's memories had nowhere to go, and so attached itself to that statue.",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						741870229
					],
					"speakerTitle": "Osse"
				},
				{
					"id": 741870229,
					"content": "So you mean that the Este here is Town-Este's ancestor, the real \"Este the Quick-Witted\"? What about the others?",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						741870230
					],
					"speakerTitle": "Paimon"
				},
				{
					"id": 741870230,
					"content": "Just wandering souls, lost in their memories. Let us go have a look.",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						741870231
					],
					"speakerTitle": "Osse"
				},
				{
					"id": 741870231,
					"content": "You walk up together with Monsieur Os...",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NEED_CLICK_BLACK_SCREEN",
					"nextDialogs": [
						741870232
					]
				},
				{
					"id": 741870232,
					"content": "Hello there, Este.",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						741870233
					],
					"speakerTitle": "Paimon"
				},
				{
					"id": 741870233,
					"content": "Yes, hello. And who are you, exactly?",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						741870234
					],
					"speakerTitle": "Este"
				},
				{
					"id": 741870234,
					"content": "You do not appear to be Remurians. Are you savages, then?",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						741870235,
						741870236
					],
					"speakerTitle": "Este"
				},
				{
					"id": 741870235,
					"content": "I'm just a passing traveler.",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_PLAYER",
					"nextDialogs": [
						741870237
					]
				},
				{
					"id": 741870237,
					"content": "Well, this is a battlefield, and you put yourselves in great peril. You should leave this place, regardless of who you are.",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						741870238
					],
					"speakerTitle": "Este"
				},
				{
					"id": 741870238,
					"content": "Este, it is I. It has been a while.",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						741870239
					],
					"speakerTitle": "Osse"
				},
				{
					"id": 741870239,
					"content": "...Skies above, it's you, Dominus Cassiodor! You so rarely appear in this form that I almost failed to recognize you.",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						741870240
					],
					"speakerTitle": "Este"
				},
				{
					"id": 741870240,
					"content": "And as for these two... Are they your attendants?",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						741870241,
						741870242
					],
					"speakerTitle": "Este"
				},
				{
					"id": 741870241,
					"content": "You can just take that to be so.",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_PLAYER",
					"nextDialogs": [
						741870245
					]
				},
				{
					"id": 741870245,
					"content": "Still, Dominus Cassiodor, what brings you here? Did the Sebastos not send you to... Damnation! I cannot remember! Am I in some dream?",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						741870246
					],
					"speakerTitle": "Este"
				},
				{
					"id": 741870246,
					"content": "That does seem to be the case.",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						741870247
					],
					"speakerTitle": "Osse"
				},
				{
					"id": 741870247,
					"content": "Haha! Surely you jest! The Sebastos must have assigned you some secret mission again, or else I am an ignoramus!",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						741870248
					],
					"speakerTitle": "Este"
				},
				{
					"id": 741870248,
					"content": "You guess correctly. Speaking of which, why are the legionnaires of Legio IX guarding those chains?",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						741870249
					],
					"speakerTitle": "Osse"
				},
				{
					"id": 741870249,
					"content": "The chains... You mean the treasure, yes? I believe them to be spoils of war.",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						741870250
					],
					"speakerTitle": "Este"
				},
				{
					"id": 741870250,
					"content": "Though the Sebastos views war as naught but a sad necessity in fulfilling our grand aspirations and has long outlawed such brutal behaviors...",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						741870251
					],
					"speakerTitle": "Este"
				},
				{
					"id": 741870251,
					"content": "You know as well as I that they have become commonplace nonetheless... We are on the path of darkness, though none perceive it.",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						741870252
					],
					"speakerTitle": "Este"
				},
				{
					"id": 741870252,
					"content": "Dominus Cassiodor, what has happened? Phobos was meant to bring us happiness, but all I feel is a pain I cannot name...",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						741870253
					],
					"speakerTitle": "Este"
				},
				{
					"id": 741870253,
					"content": "I, too, am searching for the answer to that question. But it appears that we will have to deal with the problem at hand first.",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						741870254
					],
					"speakerTitle": "Osse"
				},
				{
					"id": 741870254,
					"content": "Indeed. Still, those are our legionnaires, so let us solve things peacefully, if we may.",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [],
					"speakerTitle": "Este"
				},
				{
					"id": 741870242,
					"content": "Actually, I'm his owner.",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_PLAYER",
					"nextDialogs": [
						741870243
					]
				},
				{
					"id": 741870243,
					"content": "...Huh?",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						741870244
					],
					"speakerTitle": "Este"
				},
				{
					"id": 741870244,
					"content": "#Hey, hey, {NICKNAME}, stop complicating things further! Don't worry, {M#he}{F#she} was just joking, Este, so please, continue.",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						741870245
					],
					"speakerTitle": "Paimon"
				},
				{
					"id": 741870236,
					"content": "Oh, I can get pretty savage.",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_PLAYER",
					"nextDialogs": [
						741870237
					]
				},
				{
					"id": 741870211,
					"content": "It's that bit with the \"Treasure Hoarders\" all over again.",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_PLAYER",
					"nextDialogs": [
						741870212
					]
				}
			]
		},
		{
			"id": 7418706,
			"completionStepIds": [],
			"beginWay": "TALK_BEGIN_NONE",
			"beginConditions": {
				"logic": "LOGIC_NONE",
